<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVIA AND PARAGUAY DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVIA AND PARAGUAY DRAW 0-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia and Paraguay drew 0-0 in a South American World Cup qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
</text>
